# graphify machine-written artifacts — kept out of context to avoid
# invalidating Claude Code's prompt cache on every graph rebuild.
# GRAPH_REPORT.md is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the human-readable map.
# graph.json is consumed via `graphify query/path/explain`, not by reading it.
